@InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### User 1's investments: SOUP, OINK, RAIN
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/investments
Accept: application/json

### User 3 exists but has no investments: 200 with []
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/3/investments
Accept: application/json

### Unknown user: 404
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/99/investments
Accept: application/json

### Invalid id: 400
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/0/investments
Accept: application/json

### Two lots, Mixed term
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/investments/1
Accept: application/json

### Bought exactly one year ago: still Short
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/2/investments/4
Accept: application/json

### Every lot at a loss
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/4/investments/5
Accept: application/json

### Short-term gain
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/5/investments/7
Accept: application/json

### Another user's investment: 404, not 403
GET {{InvestmentPerformance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/1/investments/4
Accept: application/json